  "body": "## Description\nAdds a Compound: Push option for a combined dumbbell + cable bench press without logging a workout.\n\n## Changes\n- add separate adjustable dumbbell and cable load inputs\n- add adjustable incline degrees alongside reps and sets\n- display both loads and incline in workout history\n- add a replay-safe migration and refreshed anonymous snapshot\n\n## Testing\n- `npm run build` in `frontend`\n- touched-file ESLint (0 errors; existing hook warnings only)\n- removed-MSAL and image-fingerprint guards\n- OpenTofu format check\n- migration replay against a copy of current production data\n- local browser verification of independent decimal load changes\n- snapshot verified to contain the exercise and not the accidentally created workout\n\n## Deployment notes\nMigration 003 adds the shared exercise definition at pod startup. The committed snapshot already contains the previewed definition for anonymous reads.",
  "changed_files": 6,
